/* ==========================================================================
   PRODUCT DESCRIPTION + ITS "عرض المزيد" BUTTON

   The description had padding and a collapse gradient but no surface of its
   own, so it read as loose text between two panels. It now takes the same
   secondary surface as every other block on the page.

   The button was already pinned to the bottom edge and centred; what it was
   missing is the thing that makes that shape read — a WIDE ring in the page
   background colour. Two pixels of the panel colour is invisible against the
   panel it sits on. A thick ring in the colour BEHIND the panel cuts the
   button out of the edge instead, which is the effect being asked for.

   Both colours come from tokens, so dark mode needs no separate rule.
   ========================================================================== */
html body .veloura-product-page .product__description {
  background: #f8fafc !important;
  background: var(--veloura-product-secondary-bg, #f8fafc) !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: var(--veloura-integration-radius) !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
